# Story 104: Per-Mode Streams & Scrollback (45s)
# Hook: Shell, AI, Chat, Rysh -- four streams, one pane, all on your phone.
# Duration: 45s
# Source: story-104-per-mode-streams-scrollback.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:05.0]
Shell, AI, Chat, Rysh -- four streams, one pane, all on your phone.

[00:05.0 --> 00:15.0]
At the bottom of a pane, mobile shows tabs for each mode: Shell, AI, Chat, and Rysh. Each one is its own independent output stream.

[00:15.0 --> 00:25.0]
When a mode you are not looking at produces output -- say the AI finishes a reply -- that tab gets an unread badge so nothing slips past you.

[00:25.0 --> 00:36.0]
Scrollback is kept per pane and per mode, so scrolling up in the AI stream never disturbs your shell history -- each thread stays separate.

[00:36.0 --> 00:45.0]
Switch modes with a tap, scroll each one on its own -- the full four-mode model, sized for a small screen.

